        "author_association": "OWNER",
        "body": "## Issue\n\nStatic analysis identified unused code that should be removed to improve code quality.\n\n## Unused Code to Remove\n\n1. **pkg/agents/default.go:137:24** - `cleanResponseContent` function is unused (U1000)\n2. **pkg/ui/agent_messenger.go:35:2** - `contentStyle` variable is unused (U1000)\n\n## Tasks\n\n- [ ] Remove unused `cleanResponseContent` function from `pkg/agents/default.go`\n- [ ] Remove unused `contentStyle` variable from `pkg/ui/agent_messenger.go`\n- [ ] Run `go build` to ensure no build errors\n- [ ] Run `go test` to ensure all tests pass\n- [ ] Run `golangci-lint run` to verify no new issues introduced\n\n## Expected Outcome\n\nCodebase is cleaner with ~290+ lines of dead code removed, and staticcheck shows no U1000 warnings for these files.\n\n---\n\n@claude",
